# Storefront mobile performance (PageSpeed / Lighthouse)

**Baseline** (Sep 9 2026 **1:33** PM GMT+10): Perf **51**, FCP 3.3s, LCP 8.4s, TBT 420ms, SI 7.7s, CLS 0, ~14.5 MiB.  
**Post batch-1** (Sep 10 **10:11** AM): Perf **67**, FCP 2.4s, LCP 5.8s, TBT 50ms, SI 9.3s, CLS 0, ~14.2 MiB.  
**Prior** (Sep 10 **4:58** PM): Perf **74**, LCP **4.8s**, TBT 100ms, SI 8.8s, A11y **92**, payload **~4.8 MiB**.  
**Latest lab** (Sep 11 **3:29** PM GMT+10): Perf **78**, FCP **1.1s**, LCP **4.4s**, TBT **30ms**, SI **7.3s**, CLS 0.002, payload **~4.8 MiB** (4,778 KiB). A11y **92**, BP **100**, SEO **100**, Agentic **2/2**. CrUX **No Data**. Weights: FCP +10, LCP +10, TBT +30, CLS +25, SI +3.  
Full mapping: `docs/storefront-mobile-lighthouse-2026-09-09.md`. Goal: LCP ≤2.5–4s lab without Hero redesign.

## Invariant

Mobile first paint and LCP must not wait on **unused** CDN fonts, **no-store of hashed static assets**, or **entire-page** client bundles. Hero design stays protected — optimize **how** assets load.

**Hero title (learned 2026-09-12 evening):** Owner wants **text only** over the hero video/image — **no** filled scrim panel (`bg-black/*` rounded box) behind title/subtitle. Any dark box makes the media look muddy. Prefer white copy + `drop-shadow` / `text-shadow` for readability. Do **not** re-add a title background panel for A11y/PSI alone. Category card scrims are separate (OK).

